DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Prof. Rodrigo Contreras Arratia\nLuksic Visiting Scho
 lar / Assistant Professor\, Universidad Católica de Temuco\, Chile\n\nAbs
 tract:\n\nScientific advances in volcano seismology are difficult to trans
 late into actual volcano observatory practice. Scientific conclusions draw
 n from large seismic deployments or numerical modelling are not usually ad
 opted for monitoring due to limited computational resources\, scientific e
 xpertise\, and\, more importantly\, time. My (short) career has focused on
  this\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-10-08 12:10 PDT
LOCATION:Mitchell Earth Sciences
END:VEVENT
